{'symbol': 'LLY', 'date': '2022-02-16 09:00:00', 'title': 'LILLY AND BREAST CANCER ADVOCACY ORGANIZATIONS COLLABORATE TO DRIVE AWARENESS OF THE COMPLEXITIES OF EARLY BREAST CANCER AND THE RISK OF RECURRENCE', 'text': 'INDIANAPOLIS, FEB. 16, 2022 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0BREAST CANCER IS A COMPLEX DISEASE WITH MANY FACTORS THAT INFLUENCE WHETHER THE CANCER WILL RETURN OR SPREAD, YET FEW RESOURCES EXIST TO HELP PEOPLE DIAGNOSED WITH BREAST CANCER UNDERSTAND THESE RISK FACTORS. IN RECOGNIZING THE NEED FOR MORE EDUCATION ABOUT BREAST CANCER RECURRENCE, ELI LILLY AND COMPANY (NYSE: LLY) TODAY LAUNCHED A NEW EDUCATION CAMPAIGN IN COLLABORATION WITH BREASTCANCER.ORG, FOR THE BREAST OF US, LIVING BEYOND BREAST CANCER, AND SUSAN G.'}